# The "sanctuary" pass: the Workshop captures, taken on the sanctuary save "Nelims-tribe" of PickleTools' ScreenshotStudio.
# Used with -DepMap wsl-deps.sanctuary.map. Replaces wsl-deps.workshop.map for feature 11 (owner, 2026-10-04).
# Kura.ExtraStone is for the last picture (a stone from another mod); Odyssey comes with the base game set.
# camerazoom gives the close-frame step `I frame the cell` used by pictures 2 and 5.
adaptive.storage.framework   3033901359
Kura.ExtraStone              852103845
# Sanctuary Backlot (its own repository since 2026-10-08): carries the fixture Nelims-tribe and the steps of the named places (prefix "Nelim's Sanctuary:", SB).
# The other steps of these features keep the prefix "Nelim's Pickle Tools:" (NPT: studio, camera, decor, colonists, animals). The fixture must come from the Backlot only: two fixtures of that name fail Pickle.
nelim.sanctuarybacklot path:SanctuaryBacklot/Mod
nelim.pickletools.screenshotstudio path:PickleTools/ScreenshotStudio/Mod
nelim.pickletools.camerazoom path:PickleTools/CameraZoom/Mod
nelim.pickletools.clearscreen path:PickleTools/ClearScreen/Mod
